            <title>[IGNITE-11135] Incorrect time format in the chart&apos;s tooltip</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11135</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;X-axis has 24 hour format, but in the tooltip 12 hour format&lt;/p&gt;</description>
